<title>INDIA: Indian 364-day t-bill yield steady at 10.12 pct.</title>
<headline>Indian 364-day t-bill yield steady at 10.12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Wednesday it maintained the cut-off price at 90.83 rupees at its fortnightly auction of 364-day treasury bills.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield was unchanged at 10.12 percent.  </p>
<p>RBI said it accepted six bids for 1.17 billion rupees out of 13 bids for a total of 1.57 billion rupees.</p>
<p>The weighted average cut-off price was 90.83 rupees.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
